  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "ShadowAtlasPass is a core rendering service responsible for generating a depth texture atlas containing the depth information of all scene casters for shadow mapping. It implements sophisticated caching logic, only re-rendering a view if the light source, camera matrix, or any caster's state has changed. It manages WebGL resources like the depth atlas, Uniform Buffer Objects (UBOs), and utilizes specialized caster programs for depth rendering."
  },
